    {
      "text": "thou art a mighty prince among us, Gen. 23:6. as a prince hast thou power with God, Gen. 32:28. Who made thee a prince … over us, Ex. 2:14. who were the princes of the tribes, Num. 7:2. ye shall take one prince of every tribe, Num. 34:18. David assembled all the princes of Israel, 1 Chr. 28:1. Put not your trust in princes, Ps. 146:3. By me kings reign, and princes decree justice, Prov. 8:15. Thy princes are rebellious, Isa. 1:23. I will give children to be their princes, Isa. 3:4 (2 Ne. 13:4). his name shall be called … The Prince of Peace, Isa. 9:6 (2 Ne. 19:6). That bringeth the princes to nothing, Isa. 40:23. David shall be their prince for ever, Ezek. 37:25. he shall also stand up against the Prince of princes, Dan. 8:25. the prince asketh … for a reward, Micah 7:3.",
