      "text": "He casteth out devils through the prince of the devils, Matt. 9:34 (12:24; Mark 3:22). princes of the Gentiles exercise dominion, Matt. 20:25. now shall the prince of this world be cast out, John 12:31. prince of this world cometh, John 14:30. because the prince of this world is judged, John 16:11. killed the Prince of life, Acts 3:15. Him hath God exalted … to be a Prince and a Saviour, Acts 5:31. Which none of the princes of this world knew, 1 Cor. 2:8. prince of the power of the air, Eph. 2:2. Jesus Christ … prince of the kings of the earth, Rev. 1:5.",
